  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Iskandar Malaysia Urban Observatory, through NXTKey Corporation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding supports a technical assistance for the Malaysia Iskandar Regional Development Agency, the regional government body responsible for planning and development within the Iskandar economic corridor. The technical assistance will help develop the technical specifications and implementation plans for an Urban Observatory to gather, analyze, and disseminate regional data to support subnational planning and economic development.</narrative>
  </description>
